{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV《悠長假期》近日釋出最新預告，Edan呂爵安破格飾演遭遇事業樽頸的失意鋼琴家黎明俊。這次選角對應其真 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV《悠長假期》近日釋出最新預告，Edan呂爵安破格飾演遭遇事業樽頸的失意鋼琴家黎明俊。這次選角對應其真實音樂背景，原來角色設定上更隱藏了一段反差感嘅安排！</p>\n<h2>黎明俊預告曝光揭開《悠長假期》序幕</h2>\n<p>預告片中揭露了男主角黎明俊面臨人生低谷的真實寫照，更直接打出「本人因事業失意，申請休假，直至另行通知」這句具衝擊力的對白。畫面中，教授嚴厲指出他的琴聲雖然技巧完美無瑕，卻顯得過於拘謹且缺乏真實情感。這種極致的壓抑感在演奏者與聽眾之間築起了1道無形高牆，令原本才華洋溢的年輕鋼琴家陷入深深的迷惘之中。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475680313297009_20989485286af9d0c39d386.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-9\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475680313297009_20989485286af9d0c39d386.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Edan呂爵安破格飾演遭遇事業樽頸的失意鋼琴家黎明俊。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947568063415841_16208698286af9d0c6ca6e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947568063415841_16208698286af9d0c6ca6e5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>當年木村拓哉憑藉原版日劇《悠長假期》中的瀨名秀俊一角成為日劇天王，將演藝事業推向巔峰。（圖片來源：《悠長假期》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475680914181720_17776849256af9d0c9ce471.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-896-YouTube-0’18”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475680914181720_17776849256af9d0c9ce471.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>不少觀眾特別留意到劇組在美術指導上的用心佈局。有網民在討論區仔細分析畫面後表示「黎明俊間屋佈置得幾有格調喎」（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681102928112_18401664736af9d0cb863e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-8\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681102928112_18401664736af9d0cb863e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>畫面中，教授嚴厲指出他的琴聲雖然技巧完美無瑕，卻顯得過於拘謹且缺乏真實情感。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>Edan具鋼琴底子演奏畫面令人期待</h2>\n<p>這次接棒演繹世界級經典角色，正值Edan從偶像歌手向全方位演員轉型並尋求代表作的關鍵事業階段。他本身具備深厚的鋼琴底子，在音樂氣質與專業契合度上與原版人物有著極高相似點。為了完美還原這個高難度角色，他需要在拍攝期間挑戰100%鋼琴全真彈，將自身累積多年的音樂修養徹底融入劇集之中，以最真實演出回應外界期待。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681351252639_5384967686af9d0cddbeae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-6\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681351252639_5384967686af9d0cddbeae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Edan本身具備深厚的鋼琴底子，在音樂氣質與專業契合度上與原版人物有著極高相似點。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>木村拓哉憑神級角色創巔峰</h2>\n<p>當年木村拓哉憑藉原版日劇《悠長假期》中的瀨名秀俊一角成為日劇天王，將演藝事業推向巔峰。這個經典角色憂鬱內斂，對音樂充滿執著卻常在現實受挫，面對感情時更略帶笨拙與缺乏自信。黎明俊這個全新改編角色不僅保留了善良溫柔與重情義特質，更將那種懷才不遇的深沉心境高度還原，2代男主角同樣在人生低潮中默默堅持底線。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚佈置細節還原藝術家</h2>\n<p>預告曝光後隨即引爆廣泛熱議，不少觀眾特別留意到劇組在美術指導上的用心佈局。有網民在討論區仔細分析畫面後表示「黎明俊間屋佈置得幾有格調喎」、「配合返藝術家感覺，相信edan一定做好年輕鋼琴家呢個角色」。支持者認為充滿質感的場景設計能大幅提升劇情說服力，同時期待見證男主角如何從事業谷底中重新振作治癒自我。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681500734355_18353305616af9d0cf97460.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681500734355_18353305616af9d0cf97460.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Edan去了做教琴。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681745670718_8157652386af9d0d1d2b64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681745670718_8157652386af9d0d1d2b64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>佢都有失意時期（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681916446181_18951715966af9d0d39e87b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179475681916446181_18951715966af9d0d39e87b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>新劇令人期待！（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/edan/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Edan</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%82%e7%88%b5%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">呂爵安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%8e%e6%98%8e%e4%bf%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黎明俊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3543492\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 15 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T17:45:32.653879+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1458,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T15:33:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:02:27.513377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T17:38:52.171137+00:00","content_hash":"7f52f3f939b45fc018813a9ce5990accc8e68e5de27db3216faa7d33a7fde907","